<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/spot-instances> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An EC2 purchasing option that runs instances on spare EC2 capacity at a steep discount to On-Demand, in exchange for letting Amazon EC2 reclaim the capacity with a two-minute interruption notice. Suited to stateless, fault-tolerant and flexible workloads." .
